62-The same calls on the same recordings (1400 Hz, 40°), from the real-valued samples to the
63-result, with pyMUSIC run unmodified. musicrs is **14× to 784× faster** by mean time per call.
64-pyMUSIC spends ~140 ms per pseudo-spectrum building 720 `float128` steering vectors in a
65-Python loop, whatever the recording length, so the gap is widest for IFB-MUSIC (one spectrum
